        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b style='font-size:16px'&gt;How to read this&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:14px'&gt;&lt;font color='#E8732A'&gt;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&lt;/font&gt; hero loop: one closed lifecycle pass, all eight stages&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6C8EBF'&gt;&#9644; &#9644;&lt;/font&gt; measurement against the live champion&#160;&#160;&lt;font color='#B85450'&gt;&#9644; &#9644;&lt;/font&gt; guardrail rollback&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#9673A6'&gt;&#9644; &#9644;&lt;/font&gt; the loop closing: the promoted model is the next thing watched&lt;br&gt;Stages 3 and 7 are &lt;b&gt;human gates&lt;/b&gt; on ops-http; no agent can pass them.&lt;/font&gt;" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9AA7B5;fontColor=#1F2933;fontSize=14;shadow=1;">
